---
source: login/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"nologin\")"
---
Politely refuse a login.

Displays a message that an account is not available and exits non-zero. Intended as a replacement
shell field to deny login access to an account.

Usage: nologin

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
